---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";
import Icon from "@components/Icon.astro";
---

<MainGridLayout title="页面未找到">
	<section class="card-base mx-auto flex min-h-[56vh] max-w-2xl flex-col justify-center p-8 md:p-10">
		<div class="mb-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/35">404 / Missing Page</div>
		<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">这条枝路还没有长出来。</h1>
		<p class="mt-5 max-w-[42rem] text-base leading-relaxed text-white/58">
			你访问的页面不存在，或已经被移动到新的位置。可以回到首页继续浏览，也可以去归档里按时间查找文章。
		</p>
		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
			<a href="/" class="btn-regular h-11 px-5 font-bold active:scale-[0.98]">
				<Icon name="material-symbols:home-outline-rounded" class="mr-2 text-xl" />
				返回首页
			</a>
			<a href="/archive/" class="btn-plain h-11 border border-white/10 px-5 font-bold active:scale-[0.98]">
				<Icon name="material-symbols:archive-outline-rounded" class="mr-2 text-xl" />
				文章归档
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</MainGridLayout>
